cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the thesis below."
title: "Free Topological Groups (Grupos Topológicos Libres)"
authors:
  - family-names: "Broch Cubedo"
    given-names: "Carlos"
    affiliation: "Universitat Jaume I"
abstract: >-
  A detailed introduction to the theory of free topological groups: topological groups,
  abstract free groups, the Nielsen–Schreier theorem, Markov's free topological group
  (existence and universal property), a counterexample showing that freedom is not
  inherited by topological subgroups, and a proof that open subgroups of Graev free
  abelian topological groups are free.
keywords:
  - free topological groups
  - free groups
  - topological groups
  - universal property
  - Nielsen–Schreier theorem
